{"about_the_game":"You\u2019re just a small-town guy with big pastry dreams \u2014 and this summer, Paris is your playground.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/Adalt3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751285427\" /></div><br>As a baking apprentice in one of the city\u2019s most iconic patisseries, you\u2019ll whip up mouth-watering desserts, impress picky customers, and try to win the title of France\u2019s top pastry chef. But it's not just about sugar and flour...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/Adalt2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751285427\" /></div><br>You\u2019re living in a luxurious home owned by your wealthy (and very curious) distant relative, meeting gorgeous caf\u00e9 regulars, and making choices that unlock romantic, steamy, and sometimes hilarious stories.<br><br>It\u2019s a visual novel with a point-and-click twist, packed with flirty humor, summer vibes, and sweet adult content.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/Mini-game_1.gif?t=1751285427\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf53 KEY FEATURES</h2><strong>Pure Parisian Summer Vibes</strong><br>Explore the sunny streets, cozy caf\u00e9s, and secret corners of a romanticized, modern-day Paris.<br>\ud83c\udf70 <strong>Dessert-Making Mini-Games</strong><br>Mix, bake, decorate \u2014 and impress! Your skills in the kitchen lead to more than just praise\u2026 they unlock deeper (and hotter) storylines.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/Adalt1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751285427\" /></div><br>\ud83d\udc8b <strong>Branching Romance Paths</strong><br>Meet unique girls with distinct personalities and backgrounds. Choose who to bond with \u2014 or chase them all.<br>\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Life at the Mansion</strong><br>Living with your wealthy cousin? Expect surprises. Clean the house, do chores, or get into a little \u201ctrouble\u201d after hours.<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Play Your Way</strong><br>Focus on love, desserts, or both. Your choices unlock different scenes, routes, and endings. Discover every flavor of this naughty Parisian tale.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684690?t=1751285427","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684690?t=1751285427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/e941866055ba6c9e8746fc7473b1d0079d653987/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751285427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/e941866055ba6c9e8746fc7473b1d0079d653987/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751285427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains content not appropriate for all ages, or for viewing at work: sexual content, nudity. The game graphically depicts sex. All characters in the game are over the age of 18."},"demos":[{"appid":3724140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"You\u2019re just a small-town guy with big pastry dreams \u2014 and this summer, Paris is your playground.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/Adalt3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751285427\" /></div><br>As a baking apprentice in one of the city\u2019s most iconic patisseries, you\u2019ll whip up mouth-watering desserts, impress picky customers, and try to win the title of France\u2019s top pastry chef. But it's not just about sugar and flour...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\